      "value": "<p>Your strange magic grants a degree of consistency in tumultuous situations.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Incompatible Energies drawback.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> By spending an additional spell point, you may ignore any dead magic (but not antimagic) or wild magic zones you are in for the purpose of the talents’ effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
